{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/ios/Intents/CommentInClax.swift","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T09:08:10.004423Z","id":"f91f0325748d84172a641c324b82ab761de9ae12f47410ed77d77d8fb48b9147","body":{"detail":"Verified: //apps/clax_app:ios_app_test finds Metadata.appintents naming CommentInClax and \"Comment in Clax\", and on the \"Clax iPhone\" simulator (iOS 26.5) Shortcuts' All Shortcuts lists Clax with its \"Comment\" App Shortcut. Not verified: running it. xcrun simctl cannot run an App Intent, shortcuts://run-shortcut?name=Comment answers \"Could not find the shortcut\" (App Shortcuts are not library shortcuts), and no UI driver was available to tap it. The Dart half is covered by apps/clax_app/test/app_test.dart's \"the comment intent\" group and test/platform/intents_test.dart over FakeIntents and a mocked channel; the Swift half (a cold launch posting before the engine is up, a warm one after Dart asked initial) has no test.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":53},"end":{"line":57},"content_hash":"a8b31ed87dfdd2eba26120cfd1b4a5de4d4c999a93c6f48c61d9c4e4af6c7408"},"suggested_fix":"On a device or the simulator: run Comment in Clax from Shortcuts once with Clax closed and once with an app open, and check comment mode opens; or drive it from an XCUITest when the iOS integration tests gain one.","summary":"Running \"Comment in Clax\" end to end (perform, IntentInbox, IntentsChannel, Dart's comment mode) is unverified on a simulator or device","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/ios/Intents/CommentInClax.swift","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T09:08:10.036741Z","id":"19da7c687ed74f2cc332a16ee61ebcb57a4825f266c3f89450df311455ab5f66","body":{"detail":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-18-ios-release-design.md:551 lists Control Center among the places the App Intent reaches. Control Center (iOS 18) shows only ControlWidget controls, which live in a widget extension target; the app builds none, so the intent reaches the Action Button, Siri, Shortcuts and Spotlight, not Control Center.","kind":"alternative","span":{"start":{"line":60},"end":{"line":70},"content_hash":"18ce56f04f8360337854f942c6a7b42ebb22de7bc358afe444f58d21c0712010"},"summary":"A Control Center control for Comment in Clax (a ControlWidget in a widget extension)","tags":["revisit:when the app gains a widget extension (the Live Activity for builds, spec §6.2)","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
